WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.520
Work, eat, sleep, repeat.

00:01.980 --> 00:03.680
Same cycle every day, my friend.

00:04.040 --> 00:06.900
Is that really the entire plan that
you had when you moved to abroad?

00:07.420 --> 00:11.080
There are other things that you could be
doing alongside your boring 9 to 5 life.

00:11.240 --> 00:16.300
For example, you could be exploring new
skills, but again, where do you begin?

00:16.860 --> 00:20.224
You do not need hundreds of random videos
promising you instant success; even I

00:20.224 --> 00:22.000
can't promise you that.
This is all you need.

00:22.240 --> 00:26.260
You need a useful education, thoughtful
conversation and a space where you can ask

00:26.260 --> 00:30.360
the right questions. That is why we are
bringing these conversations together at a

00:30.360 --> 00:32.260
free Diaspora Wealth Network seminar.

00:32.820 --> 00:36.760
We will explore practical steps, useful
skills, and ways to find the right

00:36.760 --> 00:40.080
support. Join our free
webinar titled On Your Future.

00:40.700 --> 00:43.820
Come with your questions and
leave with ideas to explore.

00:44.580 --> 00:48.560
Now, registration is free, you can comment
the word free, and I will send you the

00:48.560 --> 00:49.900
link directly to your DMs.
